{
  "_readme": [
    "PIA-047 extraction fixtures. Consumed by scripts/test-extraction.js against the",
    "DETERMINISTIC fallbackParse() captured from BOTH html files.",
    "",
    "Scoring contract (enforced by the runner, not by convention):",
    "  · expect.* lists what MUST be found. Field-level accuracy across the whole",
    "    `parser` set must be >= 0.90.",
    "  · `forbid` lists values that must NOT appear anywhere in the extraction.",
    "    Any hit is a hard failure regardless of accuracy — this is the",
    "    'zero invented required fields' gate. Inventing an origin is far worse",
    "    than missing one: a wrong airport silently produces a wrong price and a",
    "    wrong booking link, while a missing one just asks the user a question.",
    "  · every emitted value carrying source_text must quote text present in the",
    "    input verbatim; the runner checks this on every fixture.",
    "",
    "refIso is the reference 'today' — relative dates resolve against it and",
    "nothing else, so these fixtures never depend on the wall clock."
  ],
